  <title lang="en">Huffman Coding: Effect of a Bit Error</title>
  <summary lang="en"><i>Huffman Coding: Effect of a Bit Error</i></summary>
  <description lang="en">A text in a Huffman code with one flipped bit: the receiver loses its place.</description>
  <keywords lang="en">Huffman, bit error, compression, error propagation</keywords>
  <replacements lang="en">
    <replacement key="$random number generator$" value="RandomNumberGenerator" />
    <replacement key="$output$" value="Random bytes" />
    <replacement key="$memo$" value="Change the position of the bit error in the settings of the {\\b Huffman Coding with Error Correction} component." />
  </replacements>
  <!--- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -->
